== Session Package Contract

#text(size: 9pt)\[\[
  ── TouchDesigner writes to sessions_raw/ ─────────────────────────

  sessions_raw/
    <session_id>/
      <session_id>_receipt.txt
      <session_id>_plotter.svg
      READY

  ── Uploader publishes to assets/sessions/ + Firebase ───────────────

    \\*_visitor.png   \*.wav   transcripts   raw audio
    artwork.svg   artwork_raw.svg   receipt.txt   qr.png   manifest.json

  Firebase Storage: sessions/\<session_id/>  (same 5 files)

  Ignored by pipeline:
    \\*_visitor.png   \*.wav   transcripts   raw audio
]

